14:T664,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What platforms do you provide ecommerce SEO for?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Shopify and Shopify Plus, WooCommerce, Magento (Adobe Commerce), BigCommerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud and custom-built ecommerce platforms. Each has specific technical SEO requirements — we know all of them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you handle SEO for large product catalogs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Large catalogs require systematic approaches to indexation control, faceted navigation, pagination and content scale. We implement templates and processes that apply SEO best practices programmatically across thousands of product pages — not just to your top 50 SKUs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you help an ecommerce store rank against Amazon and major retailers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — and this is one of the most common challenges we tackle. The strategy involves targeting specific long-tail product terms Amazon doesn't optimize for, building content layers that capture pre-purchase research queries, and building the brand authority that lets you compete on category terms over time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's the ROI of ecommerce SEO vs paid search?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SEO takes longer to build than paid search but produces compounding returns — traffic you don't pay per click for. Our ecommerce SEO clients typically see a break-even point within 6–12 months and significantly higher ROI than paid search by month 18+."}}]}9:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Ecommerce SEO for Online Stores\",\"description\":\"Expert ecommerce SEO services for online stores across every platform and product category. Product page SEO, category optimization, technical ecommerce SEO and content strategy for US market rankings.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\"areaServed\":\"US\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com/services/ecommerce-seo-online-stores\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$14"}}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"svc-hero theme-dark","id":"top","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-glow"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"wrap","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"crumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/#services","children":"Digital Marketing"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"here","children":"Ecommerce SEO for Online Stores"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"svc-hero-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Ecommerce SEO Agency"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"svc-title","style":{"marginTop":18},"children":"Ecommerce SEO for Online Stores"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"svc-lead","children":"Ecommerce SEO services are the specialized optimization practices that drive organic search traffic to online stores — covering the technical challenges unique to ecommerce platforms, the commercial-intent keyword strategy that targets buyers at the point of purchase, and the content infrastructure that builds long-term topical authority. Our ecommerce SEO services address the specific challenges of large catalogs, faceted navigation, duplicate product content, collection page optimization and product schema that general SEO agencies routinely get wrong. Agentix provides ecommerce SEO services across Shopify, WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce and custom platforms — serving fashion, beauty, health, home, food, sports, electronics, pets and every other product category. Our Shopify SEO services, ecommerce search optimization and ecommerce SEO agency work are built around one metric: organic revenue, not just organic traffic."}],"$L16"]}],"$L17"]}]]}]]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]]
